WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Hello everybody!

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.090
My name is Markiplier...

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:03.320
...and welcome to Daylight.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.230
An actual AAA horror game...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.660
...that a lot of people had been eagerly awaiting.

00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:09.739
Now, I apologise in advance...

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:11.351
...my voice is a little bit tender today.

00:00:11.351 --> 00:00:12.850
So I have to this in a more...

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.919
...somber, quiet, calm tone as opposed to...

00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:19.179
...my normal, very shouty and bombastic self.

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:22.216
But either way, I am eagerly anticipating--

00:00:22.216 --> 00:00:24.473
Oh... no, not a spider!

00:00:26.766 --> 00:00:27.273
Yes?

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:28.560
Okay.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.425
My name is Mark.

00:00:34.225 --> 00:00:34.545
Okay.

00:00:36.158 --> 00:00:37.298
Much to learn...

00:00:38.591 --> 00:00:40.111
Indeed, where am I?

00:00:41.301 --> 00:00:41.721
Huh.

00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:49.798
Okay.

00:00:49.798 --> 00:00:50.340
(Pfft!...)

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.264
(...I'm trying to read here!)

00:00:53.064 --> 00:00:53.624
Okay.

00:00:53.624 --> 00:00:55.044
[read it there ↑ :)]

00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:07.546
Oh, no.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:08.800
Oh, eww. Heh-heugh.

00:01:09.258 --> 00:01:11.538
Was that just sitting there in that wheelchair?

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.718
That's mildly disturbing.

00:01:13.846 --> 00:01:15.336
Okay, so Daylight is actually...

00:01:15.336 --> 00:01:17.796
...a procedurally generated game, that is...

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:19.895
...supposedly random in the events.

00:01:19.895 --> 00:01:21.344
Maybe not on the layout.

00:01:24.419 --> 00:01:25.308
Wait, what?!

00:01:25.308 --> 00:01:26.518
That didn't make any sense.

00:01:26.518 --> 00:01:27.728
"There I go, where I am"?

00:01:27.728 --> 00:01:28.788
I am exactly where I am...

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.008
...and I am who I am, but I dunno--

00:01:30.008 --> 00:01:31.418
Oh no, I've gone cross-eyed...

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:33.549
[ ↑ ]

00:01:48.171 --> 00:01:49.901
Is that Dr. Mercer?

00:01:50.053 --> 00:01:52.243
Wasn't there a Dr. Mercer in the... uh...

00:01:52.243 --> 00:01:53.823
...Outlast asylum?

00:01:53.823 --> 00:01:56.523
Why is there a mushroom sitting on that bed over there?

00:01:57.207 --> 00:01:57.647
Okay.

00:02:00.003 --> 00:02:01.963
Ooo, I've found a lot of glowsticks.

00:02:01.963 --> 00:02:04.153
"Use Glowsticks to search deeper."

00:02:04.153 --> 00:02:06.273
How much deeper are we talking about here?

00:02:06.794 --> 00:02:08.074
Can I carry up to a maximum--

00:02:08.346 --> 00:02:10.316
Oooh. Wow.

00:02:10.316 --> 00:02:11.806
I got so more mellow.

00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:15.278
Sooo, now we're going to sta-- okay, that's glowing.

00:02:15.278 --> 00:02:16.398
That's a little weird.

00:02:17.579 --> 00:02:19.329
[ ↑ ]

00:02:25.669 --> 00:02:29.089
Oh... well, cool tats, bro.

00:02:30.857 --> 00:02:33.207
Yeah, but WHY are they burning into my flesh?!

00:02:33.207 --> 00:02:35.447
That is exactly what I'm trying to find out here, because...

00:02:35.447 --> 00:02:38.227
...things seems to be a little bit odd,
if you know what I mean.

00:02:38.517 --> 00:02:41.167
Anyway, so the game is procedurally generated up to a--

00:02:42.396 --> 00:02:43.416
HOH! Hi!

00:02:43.947 --> 00:02:46.327
Ummm... Hello?

00:02:46.513 --> 00:02:48.243
Why were you there?

00:02:48.369 --> 00:02:50.369
I'm trying to be a bit more easy on my voice...

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:51.369
...so if you can not--

00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:56.576
Okay. All right.

00:02:57.718 --> 00:02:58.288
Huh!

00:02:59.258 --> 00:03:02.598
Excuse me, I'm trying to be a little bit more tender...

00:03:02.598 --> 00:03:05.608
...ooon my voice. What the hell is happening?

00:03:06.074 --> 00:03:07.554
Could you not?

00:03:08.644 --> 00:03:10.207
I may have to just give up...

00:03:10.207 --> 00:03:11.550
...all anticipation on trying to be quiet...

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.104
...because I got my microphone set up...

00:03:13.104 --> 00:03:14.368
...a little bit higher volume here...

00:03:14.368 --> 00:03:16.784
...so if I scream it's gonna blow everything out.

00:03:17.188 --> 00:03:20.738
I don't aim to scream and destroy all your eardrums.

00:03:21.025 --> 00:03:23.085
So I gotta try to remain reserved.

00:03:23.978 --> 00:03:26.508
Oh! What the...? Oh, that's paint on the ceiling.

00:03:26.508 --> 00:03:28.638
I thought that was some arms dripping down.

00:03:28.838 --> 00:03:30.508
Well, okay, that was weird.

00:03:30.775 --> 00:03:32.455
But was there any point in coming in here?

00:03:33.565 --> 00:03:37.085
Oookay. I guess nooot.

00:03:37.943 --> 00:03:40.033
Well, I'll just carry on my way then.

00:03:40.254 --> 00:03:42.284
Hello creepy painting of a little girl.

00:03:42.434 --> 00:03:44.025
A-shugga-shugga-shugga.

00:03:44.025 --> 00:03:45.616
[door squeaks]

00:03:45.616 --> 00:03:47.208
Squeeeeek.

00:03:48.564 --> 00:03:50.694
Was that me screaming like a little girl?

00:03:51.256 --> 00:03:51.846
I am--

00:03:53.885 --> 00:03:54.375
'Kay.

00:03:55.013 --> 00:03:55.793
What the hell was that?

00:03:56.281 --> 00:03:57.949
"Once a small fishing ville in New Kipling--"

00:03:57.949 --> 00:03:59.739
I'm gonna give up. I'm gonna go back to my normal--

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:00.769
I'm gonna go back to my normal stuff...

00:04:00.769 --> 00:04:02.879
...because this is gonna get LOUD, I know it.

00:04:03.157 --> 00:04:04.297
[ ↑ ]

00:04:11.595 --> 00:04:14.895
Uuuhwell then... aaallrighty.

00:04:16.707 --> 00:04:19.517
What was what? I didn't see any-- 'xcuse me!

00:04:19.517 --> 00:04:20.897
Why did that go away?

00:04:21.653 --> 00:04:22.253
What's happening?

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.050
What's going on?

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.060
I don't much care for this.

00:04:26.605 --> 00:04:28.295
If you wanna stop being a douche any time...

00:04:28.295 --> 00:04:29.755
...I would really appreciate it.

00:04:30.704 --> 00:04:31.254
Ugh.

00:04:32.322 --> 00:04:33.552
This game gave me the heebie-jeebies...

00:04:33.552 --> 00:04:35.692
...awfully early on into my playthrough here.

00:04:35.872 --> 00:04:37.662
Why is there a dresser with a mirror on it?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.770
What? Why?

00:04:40.703 --> 00:04:42.633
Once again, I need to reiterate that I've never played...

00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:45.363
...this game before, and-- oh, there's a brain...

00:04:47.131 --> 00:04:49.651
What? I didn't find anything!

00:04:49.863 --> 00:04:51.103
You didn't give me anything!

00:04:51.103 --> 00:04:52.683
Why is that spinning on there?

00:04:52.999 --> 00:04:54.769
Ugh, is that following me?!

00:04:55.283 --> 00:04:57.723
That's kinda weird. You don't have eyes or anything...

00:04:57.723 --> 00:04:59.433
...so it's not really that bad, I guess.

00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:02.143
Oh, okay. Oookay.

00:05:04.913 --> 00:05:06.783
Oookay, I hear something!

00:05:06.783 --> 00:05:08.483
My phone's going all wibbly-wobbly!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.330
Or this machine, am I--

00:05:11.908 --> 00:05:13.898
Wanna run that by me again, douche?

00:05:15.603 --> 00:05:18.573
SHUT-- there's something there!

00:05:19.239 --> 00:05:20.859
There was something there!

00:05:21.018 --> 00:05:22.498
You can't tell me there wasn't!

00:05:22.747 --> 00:05:24.047
I know what I saw!

00:05:27.358 --> 00:05:28.198
What flames?

00:05:28.644 --> 00:05:30.854
Oh, I got a flare. Can I get more flares?

00:05:31.315 --> 00:05:33.065
What... what's gonna harm me?

00:05:33.393 --> 00:05:34.633
Please, tell me!

00:05:34.777 --> 00:05:36.457
I would like to knoooow!

00:05:36.728 --> 00:05:38.368
Something bad's gonna happen.

00:05:38.698 --> 00:05:40.208
Something bad's gonna happen to my butt.

00:05:40.761 --> 00:05:41.901
Okey-dokey.

00:05:43.141 --> 00:05:43.601
UGH.

00:05:43.601 --> 00:05:47.182
[ ↑ ]

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:55.283
Maybe it w--

00:05:56.891 --> 00:05:58.231
Maybe it was her baby.

00:05:58.441 --> 00:06:01.041
Maybe I don't much appreciate all this stuff happening.

00:06:01.921 --> 00:06:03.381
You get out of here with this noise!

00:06:04.281 --> 00:06:05.541
You get outta here with this odd noise!

00:06:07.009 --> 00:06:09.949
What- what do I- wait, there was something I could use...

00:06:10.154 --> 00:06:11.164
...or was there?

00:06:11.324 --> 00:06:13.034
Oh! Oh, the door!

00:06:14.045 --> 00:06:16.795
Uh, a swirly mist someone left
after going to the bathroom!

00:06:17.526 --> 00:06:18.046
Wait...

00:06:18.046 --> 00:06:19.126
[ ↑ ]

00:06:29.872 --> 00:06:31.852
Thaaat doesn't seem very nice!

00:06:34.044 --> 00:06:35.164
I heard something!

00:06:37.425 --> 00:06:38.505
I heard something!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:42.760
The hell do I hear?!

00:06:43.264 --> 00:06:43.871
Ugh.

00:06:44.301 --> 00:06:45.078
Ohkay.

00:06:45.678 --> 00:06:47.099
All righty then.

00:06:47.699 --> 00:06:48.760
SHUT THE FUCK--

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.478
Oh, there' s a thingy! I know there's a thingy!

00:06:51.478 --> 00:06:52.806
I saw the thingy!

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:54.116
Uhhhh.

00:06:55.527 --> 00:06:57.647
Okay. COME ON, bring it on!

00:06:57.857 --> 00:07:00.157
I'm just too... tough... for you.

00:07:01.306 --> 00:07:03.196
God! You know, I was originally worried...

00:07:03.196 --> 00:07:04.856
...that this would be a lot like Outlast...

00:07:04.856 --> 00:07:06.926
...but this is actually a very different experience.

00:07:07.066 --> 00:07:09.626
I mean besides the holding up of the thing--

00:07:09.712 --> 00:07:11.262
Oooh, there's something in there!

00:07:11.413 --> 00:07:12.333
HelloOo?

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:12.813
No?

00:07:13.648 --> 00:07:15.748
No one sitting on the toilet tryin' to scare me?

00:07:16.278 --> 00:07:17.348
No? Okay.

00:07:17.348 --> 00:07:18.718
A-shakey-shakey-shakey.

00:07:18.894 --> 00:07:22.444
All right! So-- oh, there is a tiny-- wait, what?

00:07:22.444 --> 00:07:24.324
NO! I wasn't done with that!

00:07:24.324 --> 00:07:25.784
Or maybe it just ran out... I don't know.

00:07:26.788 --> 00:07:28.608
Oh, god! I thought that was something.

00:07:28.608 --> 00:07:30.358
Those... those lights look like eye--

00:07:30.358 --> 00:07:33.268
[whispering]

00:07:33.268 --> 00:07:36.118
Watch... wash the poopdeck? Wash the lift deck?

00:07:36.118 --> 00:07:36.668
What did you s--

00:07:36.668 --> 00:07:39.178
[more whispering]

00:07:39.178 --> 00:07:40.318
You gonna get me?

00:07:40.527 --> 00:07:41.557
Who's gonna get me?

00:07:42.326 --> 00:07:43.386
I dunno what you're gonna get...

00:07:43.386 --> 00:07:44.576
...but please don't let it be me!

00:07:44.576 --> 00:07:45.986
Okay, another bathroom!

00:07:46.336 --> 00:07:46.656
Why?

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.830
Why am I in these bathrooms?!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.720
What was that? What was that?!

00:07:54.356 --> 00:07:56.006
God, I don't even know what I hear!

00:07:56.006 --> 00:07:56.506
It's always--

00:07:56.506 --> 00:07:58.130
It's always interesting to have a new horror game...

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.200
...because they always like to...

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:00.280
...throw different things at you...

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.650
...and you don't know what to expect.

00:08:01.761 --> 00:08:02.124
I mean...

00:08:02.124 --> 00:08:03.937
...with most of the indie horror games that I've played...

00:08:03.937 --> 00:08:07.791
...it's oftentimes that things get rather similar, so...

00:08:08.741 --> 00:08:10.631
...it's good to have a fresh approach, I guess.

00:08:10.861 --> 00:08:14.861
Okay, so... guess I'll go here. Did I not go over here?

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:16.541
No, I was all stopped up.

00:08:16.741 --> 00:08:17.851
Where do I go?!

00:08:18.121 --> 00:08:19.861
I'm a little bit lost. I can't--

00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:20.881
Okay, map.

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:24.281
Okay. Zoom in, zoom in, zoom in.

00:08:24.281 --> 00:08:25.531
Okay, so it looks like there was actually...

00:08:25.531 --> 00:08:27.031
...and open door over here on the right.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:31.130
If we go over here... yeah, yeah, yeah-yeah-yeah, okay.

00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:34.106
All right. Come on! Come on! Bring it on!

00:08:34.106 --> 00:08:35.256
I'm ready for ya!

00:08:35.598 --> 00:08:36.538
I'm with it--

00:08:37.168 --> 00:08:39.378
Hi! That church--that church! [chuckles]

00:08:39.378 --> 00:08:41.038
That chair just fixed itself.

00:08:41.728 --> 00:08:42.998
All right. So these...

00:08:43.235 --> 00:08:45.435
[ ↑ ]

00:08:59.398 --> 00:09:00.828
Okay. All right.

00:09:02.689 --> 00:09:03.849
I'm sorry I'm relaxed a bit...

00:09:03.849 --> 00:09:05.759
...they haven't actually thrown anything at me,...

00:09:05.759 --> 00:09:06.899
...except for that beginning part.

00:09:08.109 --> 00:09:10.099
Aaaaand now the music is climbing.

00:09:10.099 --> 00:09:12.339
Wait a minute, were those three separate things?

00:09:13.009 --> 00:09:15.899
Why the f-- Why the strings climbing up?

00:09:16.949 --> 00:09:17.689
Closed it--

00:09:18.101 --> 00:09:18.551
Ah!

00:09:20.849 --> 00:09:21.479
What?!

00:09:21.764 --> 00:09:23.334
Do what now with what?

00:09:23.788 --> 00:09:26.048
[ ↑ ]

00:09:34.998 --> 00:09:36.828
OKAY, what's with the strings?!

00:09:37.808 --> 00:09:39.218
Being a douche to me...

00:09:39.628 --> 00:09:41.118
I don't much appreciate it.

00:09:41.687 --> 00:09:43.297
Uuh-kay. There we go.

00:09:44.067 --> 00:09:46.807
I heard that! SHUT. UP.

00:09:47.708 --> 00:09:51.178
I don't want none of it! SHUT. UP.

00:09:54.038 --> 00:09:54.668
'kay.

00:09:55.508 --> 00:09:56.118
SHUT.

00:09:56.858 --> 00:09:57.408
UP!

00:09:58.164 --> 00:10:01.524
I don't want... none... can I use it with-- thank you.

00:10:01.574 --> 00:10:03.724
[ ↑ ]

00:10:11.001 --> 00:10:12.801
Well I guess I AM.

00:10:13.221 --> 00:10:14.371
Hello wheelchair.

00:10:14.801 --> 00:10:18.021
Uh, just sitting oddly in the middle of... nothing.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:20.730
'Kay.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.296
What am I doing?!

00:10:23.876 --> 00:10:25.812
[ ↑ ]

00:10:32.652 --> 00:10:33.330
Th--

00:10:35.132 --> 00:10:35.872
HEUGH!

00:10:37.248 --> 00:10:37.738
'Kay.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:41.600
Oh, hi! What is that? Is that what I need?

00:10:43.765 --> 00:10:44.365
No!

00:10:44.725 --> 00:10:45.165
HAH!

00:10:45.336 --> 00:10:45.826
No!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.440
What is that?

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:49.680
Do I want that?

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.860
Do I want or not want to touch that?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.370
I'm gonna touch it.

00:10:53.824 --> 00:10:56.024
"There's gotta be a key." What are you talking about?

00:10:56.351 --> 00:10:57.871
Oooh, that's the locked door.

00:10:57.871 --> 00:10:59.011
That's the sigil he was talking about,...

00:10:59.011 --> 00:11:00.131
...that I need to bring them.

00:11:01.034 --> 00:11:02.244
"Anybody there?"

00:11:02.244 --> 00:11:03.634
NO! Don't say that!

00:11:03.944 --> 00:11:07.604
Don't say that! Why would you say that?! You're a moron!

00:11:10.138 --> 00:11:10.788
What?

00:11:10.954 --> 00:11:12.084
Whaaaatever.

00:11:12.467 --> 00:11:13.747
Whaatever.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.690
Oh, what do we do? What do we do?

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.060
What do we do, I am s--

00:11:19.825 --> 00:11:21.055
I AM SORRY!

00:11:24.936 --> 00:11:26.206
Okay. Cool.

00:11:26.476 --> 00:11:28.746
That's good. I like that. That was good.

00:11:28.746 --> 00:11:30.246
Let's never do that again.

00:11:30.866 --> 00:11:32.516
What is going on here?!

00:11:32.828 --> 00:11:33.888
I don't know!

00:11:34.028 --> 00:11:35.228
[whispering]

00:11:35.228 --> 00:11:35.838
SHUT UP!

00:11:37.046 --> 00:11:37.816
Shut up!

00:11:39.677 --> 00:11:41.097
Okay, okay. Come on!

00:11:41.174 --> 00:11:43.264
There's gotta be a key, that's what she said.

00:11:43.264 --> 00:11:44.874
There's gotta be a key somewhere.

00:11:45.042 --> 00:11:46.638
There's gotta be another place I can open.

00:11:46.638 --> 00:11:47.284
This looks like it--

00:11:47.284 --> 00:11:48.552
Oh, that's just a door frame.

00:11:49.095 --> 00:11:50.235
God! What do I do?

00:11:50.405 --> 00:11:52.115
Oh, okay. Here, here, here.

00:11:52.115 --> 00:11:53.105
I haven't been here before.

00:11:53.434 --> 00:11:56.064
Okay. All right. Come on! Come on, come on!

00:11:56.924 --> 00:11:57.824
Come on! Come on!

00:11:57.824 --> 00:11:58.784
Oh, that fixed itself again.

00:11:58.784 --> 00:12:00.034
Wait, I have been here before!

00:12:00.418 --> 00:12:01.518
Oh, it's very the same.

00:12:02.089 --> 00:12:02.699
Wait a minute...

00:12:02.699 --> 00:12:04.079
[ ↑ ]

00:12:16.602 --> 00:12:18.812
Well, good. That always works better.

00:12:19.266 --> 00:12:21.636
Okay, found a glowstick. I got glowsticks.

00:12:21.636 --> 00:12:22.856
That's good for me!

00:12:23.072 --> 00:12:24.172
But not good for many other people.

00:12:25.233 --> 00:12:25.603
Okay.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:29.310
The tats on my arm seem to be getting a bit strongeeer.

00:12:31.345 --> 00:12:31.895
SHUT.

00:12:32.762 --> 00:12:33.752
YOUR MOUTH.

00:12:34.365 --> 00:12:35.845
I don't wanna hear none of it.

00:12:36.167 --> 00:12:41.307
[tinkling music]

00:12:41.412 --> 00:12:43.492
I don't wanna open that door!
"What's that sound?"

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:46.470
Oooh, good for meee!

00:12:46.677 --> 00:12:47.667
Oh, this is good!

00:12:49.033 --> 00:12:50.343
