And why does that sound keep following me?

00:26:57.156 --> 00:26:57.902
All right, come on!

00:26:58.843 --> 00:27:01.211
Oh. Nothing's actually been happening!

00:27:01.900 --> 00:27:02.947
Okay, here we go!

00:27:03.198 --> 00:27:03.675
Here we go.

00:27:03.695 --> 00:27:05.260
This sounds-- this looks like it's something.

00:27:05.551 --> 00:27:05.972
Wait, what?

00:27:06.587 --> 00:27:07.276
Come on, no.

00:27:07.625 --> 00:27:08.645
Oh, I need to find another remnant...

00:27:08.645 --> 00:27:09.704
...before I can go there!

00:27:10.153 --> 00:27:11.525
God-dingus-dammit!

00:27:11.891 --> 00:27:12.917
[whispering]

00:27:12.917 --> 00:27:13.399
Shut up!

00:27:14.257 --> 00:27:15.157
Shup up! It's not true!

00:27:16.142 --> 00:27:17.189
I'm not one of you!

00:27:17.844 --> 00:27:18.867
I'm not crazy!

00:27:19.358 --> 00:27:20.591
You're crazy for thinking I'm crazy!

00:27:21.246 --> 00:27:24.506
I can't see-- I can see plenty of things Sarah!

00:27:25.516 --> 00:27:27.836
Sarah, if you could just get off your ass...

00:27:27.836 --> 00:27:28.839
...and start doing some work here!

00:27:30.046 --> 00:27:31.366
Maybe we could get to where we need to go!

00:27:31.904 --> 00:27:33.146
'Kay, now we found a locked door!

00:27:33.716 --> 00:27:35.157
GOD, I just need one more remnant!

00:27:35.980 --> 00:27:36.905
One more remnant!

00:27:37.688 --> 00:27:38.563
Oooh, it's empty!!

00:27:39.547 --> 00:27:41.103
Son of bitches, stop messing with me!

00:27:44.097 --> 00:27:45.719
GOD, NOTHING! DEAD END!

00:27:46.119 --> 00:27:47.613
I keep founding dead ends and nothingness!

00:27:48.050 --> 00:27:49.527
I'm on my last glowstick guys.

00:27:50.143 --> 00:27:51.223
If I don't find anything now...

00:27:51.223 --> 00:27:52.466
...I'm gonna be kinda screwed.

00:27:54.501 --> 00:27:56.399
Uhh... I gotta go down...

00:27:56.399 --> 00:27:57.461
Oh, no, wait, I can go this way.

00:27:59.032 --> 00:28:00.985
I don't wanna go-- OH, REMNANT!

00:28:01.165 --> 00:28:02.863
Got it! Yess!

00:28:03.133 --> 00:28:03.832
"They will haunt you..."

00:28:03.832 --> 00:28:05.141
[ ↑ ]

00:28:20.444 --> 00:28:21.821
OHFUCKINGGODDAMMIT!!!

00:28:22.084 --> 00:28:22.940
[noises of fear]

00:28:22.940 --> 00:28:23.692
NO! FLARE!

00:28:23.692 --> 00:28:24.284
I'LL KILL YOU!

00:28:24.284 --> 00:28:24.956
HRRGH!

00:28:26.456 --> 00:28:27.838
You son of a bitch!

00:28:28.368 --> 00:28:29.801
I am not gonna forgive you for that one!

00:28:30.586 --> 00:28:31.438
Ohhohoho.

00:28:31.949 --> 00:28:32.982
Ohhohoho!

00:28:33.595 --> 00:28:35.221
Okay, I gotta go to the room.

00:28:35.753 --> 00:28:36.513
Get the teddy bear!

00:28:37.012 --> 00:28:38.302
GET THE TEDDY BEAR!

00:28:38.946 --> 00:28:39.977
GET THE THINGY!

00:28:41.151 --> 00:28:42.207
Yes please!

00:28:42.297 --> 00:28:43.410
Thank you! Gimme, gimme, gimme!

00:28:44.147 --> 00:28:45.586
Knife.
[It's a pair of scissors, you big, scared dumbo :)]

00:28:47.446 --> 00:28:48.121
Okay.

00:28:50.354 --> 00:28:51.042
Ugh.

00:28:54.805 --> 00:28:55.397
Yeah.

00:29:01.659 --> 00:29:02.457
Yeah, okay.

00:29:03.147 --> 00:29:04.048
You got it, bro!

00:29:04.569 --> 00:29:05.305
YOU GOT IT, BRO!

00:29:05.525 --> 00:29:06.284
You get outta here!

00:29:06.480 --> 00:29:07.570
You stay away from me!

00:29:07.811 --> 00:29:08.916
I got a place I need to go!

00:29:09.132 --> 00:29:11.154
At least Sarah doesn't run out of sprint juice!

00:29:11.484 --> 00:29:13.482
It's like Sarah's been running a bit in her time.

00:29:13.986 --> 00:29:15.811
Eugh, get it, get it, get it, getitgetitgetit!

00:29:19.123 --> 00:29:20.313
TADAA!

00:29:21.066 --> 00:29:23.121
♪♫TATARATARARAAA!♪♫

00:29:23.626 --> 00:29:24.187
Okay.

00:29:25.155 --> 00:29:26.180
Oooh, found glowsticks.

00:29:27.000 --> 00:29:27.502
H-okay.

00:29:28.285 --> 00:29:29.367
Let's just take a breather here.

00:29:30.023 --> 00:29:31.232
Let's stop up for a second.

00:29:31.516 --> 00:29:32.449
Catch my breath.

00:29:32.449 --> 00:29:33.287
Maaaan.

00:29:33.756 --> 00:29:35.050
I think imma stop this episode here.

00:29:35.390 --> 00:29:38.830
But good GOD! UGHhuhhuh.

00:29:39.342 --> 00:29:40.607
This game isn't about, like...

00:29:40.607 --> 00:29:41.986
Th-the thing I like about this game...

00:29:41.986 --> 00:29:43.289
...and... and a lot of people... you know... will...

00:29:43.289 --> 00:29:45.115
...might.. may agree with me of disagree with me...

00:29:45.115 --> 00:29:45.640
...this game...

00:29:46.771 --> 00:29:49.176
...it doesn't just constantly throws stuff at you.

00:29:49.416 --> 00:29:50.840
It constantly made me think...

00:29:50.980 --> 00:29:52.338
...something was about to happen.

00:29:52.450 --> 00:29:54.718
Like that, be all these little things that were happening...

00:29:54.718 --> 00:29:56.168
...I was like: "It's gonna turn into something big!"...

00:29:56.578 --> 00:29:58.512
...because a-- with all my experience
with my indie games...

00:29:58.698 --> 00:30:00.401
...like, there's always like something small...

00:30:00.401 --> 00:30:01.194
...and something big...

00:30:01.194 --> 00:30:01.861
...that's all is what it is.

00:30:02.480 --> 00:30:03.455
But this thing has pacing...

00:30:03.752 --> 00:30:05.381
...and it's really cool to see that...

00:30:05.381 --> 00:30:08.096
...actually be portrayed correctly in a game, so...

00:30:08.216 --> 00:30:10.213
...I'm very excited to be playing this game.

00:30:10.319 --> 00:30:11.179
But(!)...

00:30:11.298 --> 00:30:13.410
...this is game is designed...

00:30:13.602 --> 00:30:15.631
...to be played via live stream.

00:30:15.799 --> 00:30:17.087
And I'm not joking about that!

00:30:17.268 --> 00:30:18.686
It can integrate with my Twitch...

00:30:18.928 --> 00:30:20.749
...and that way it goes to the chat...

00:30:20.755 --> 00:30:22.048
...of the Twitch channel, that I'm using...

00:30:22.125 --> 00:30:25.036
...and you guys can mess with me!

00:30:25.200 --> 00:30:27.541
There's specific commands that you can use...

00:30:27.571 --> 00:30:29.618
...to mess with someone who's playing it live.

00:30:29.618 --> 00:30:31.527
And I want you guys to have that experience...

00:30:31.739 --> 00:30:33.285
...but I don't know if you want me to play...

00:30:33.397 --> 00:30:35.283
...the series on my YouTube channel...

00:30:35.421 --> 00:30:37.963
...or do live streaming, and take highlights from that...

00:30:38.028 --> 00:30:39.832
...and then put them on the channel later.

00:30:39.986 --> 00:30:41.659
So I need your help on this one, guys.

00:30:41.659 --> 00:30:43.430
I need you to help me decide what to do.

00:30:43.430 --> 00:30:45.360
If you guys want me to do a live stream...

00:30:45.360 --> 00:30:46.609
...which is kinda what I wanna do...

00:30:46.609 --> 00:30:48.112
...leave a like down below to let me know...

00:30:48.112 --> 00:30:49.968
...or write in the comments to tell me...

00:30:49.968 --> 00:30:50.851
...what you guys want.

00:30:50.851 --> 00:30:52.919
So, this is really up to YOU...

00:30:52.919 --> 00:30:54.863
...'cause I could do just a normal series of this...

00:30:54.863 --> 00:30:57.505
...on YouTube, but I rather get you guys involved with it.

00:30:57.505 --> 00:30:58.573
So, let me know!

00:30:59.053 --> 00:30:59.776
Anyway...

00:30:59.776 --> 00:31:00.944
...thank you all so much for watching!

00:31:00.944 --> 00:31:02.015
Click the annotation...

00:31:02.015 --> 00:31:03.205
...for more horror games that I've done...

00:31:03.715 --> 00:31:04.164
...and as always...

00:31:04.294 --> 00:31:06.119
...I will see YOU...

00:31:06.479 --> 00:31:07.369
...in the next video!

00:31:08.639 --> 00:31:09.334
